{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:30 2026-11-09 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣細碼比堅尼騷人妻誘惑  新婚解放豐滿上圍超吸睛  小麥式皮膚配長腿展港姐美態\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f71791119a988be5a0db1894b5dfdba7/2026-11/Copy_of_KF__53.png\"/>\n<p>34歲的2015年港姐亞軍龐卓欣，今年9月才與拍拖五年的富二代男友Patrick舉行簡單而溫馨的簽字註冊儀式，正式升格做幸福人妻。新婚燕爾的她日前隨即「大解放」，相約一眾閨密出海開遊艇派對。相中可見，新婚後的龐卓欣狀態大勇，穿上一套鮮艷奪目的亮黃色三點式比堅尼，搭配同色系的小短裙，在遊艇上展現玲瓏有致的S形火辣身材。她戴上時尚太陽眼鏡，對著鏡頭展露燦爛的甜美笑容，不時大方擺出誘人姿勢，吸睛度爆燈。</p>\n<h2>龐卓欣與好姊妹開遊艇泳衣派對</h2>\n<p>龐卓欣這趟出海之旅可謂是視覺盛宴，她與一眾好姊妹並排坐在遊艇甲板上，迎著藍天白雲與清澈海景，畫面美不勝收。期間龐卓欣情緒高漲，興奮地對著鏡頭揮手及大擺V字手勢，更與身旁穿上深紅色比堅尼的閨密貼臉自拍，澎湃的上圍與健康膚色在陽光照射下顯得格外迷人。升格為人妻後的她不僅沒有收斂，反而展現出更勝從前的自信與大方，網民紛紛大讚她嫁人後越來越靚。</p>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣生活無憂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/223bb5c0f8dc24a3a86c5a21699de3d9/2023-03/ADA_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣與父母合照，有指其父龐寶林是股評人、基金公司管理董事總經理，身家逾億。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac73238e1869f224cd5cee05c433a08e/2026-09/ADA_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣新婚後大解放，戴上太陽眼鏡的她，與身穿深紅色比堅尼的閨密貼臉自拍，大晒豐滿上圍與健康膚色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/027087129b68530d90e8e28719308d28/2026-11/SaveClip_App_898504936_18653859469012176_3007629749076889853_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣跪在遊艇沙發前甜笑迎鏡頭，新婚狀態大勇，散發極致誘惑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6013c536b5ab18d1042306e76427f0b6/2026-11/SaveClip_App_894252401_18653859457012176_7466919584990877423_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣近年當上KOL。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d665db03a29e67f160dbbe8e1cdadd3e/2023-03/ADA_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣不時於社交網分享日常點滴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f45e064e06e3f1d31f68726c827b75d/2023-03/ADA_02_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣成日去旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e38f32e0d0da2f4c9ab9111f7818d8d/2023-03/ADA_07_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣熱愛打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42fdaead30c17727a860fb970f644bb0/2023-03/ADA_22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣卸任後一直過着優哉游哉的生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc614e13454c27be4fcaea4a692ee1a4/2023-03/ADA_00.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣話自己好努力搵錢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60327420c38359de08eb7ea4750c09d0/2023-07/VideoScreenshot--adapcyInstagram-0_03_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣經常拍片放在IG。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f76559227e48a2244d158615c5b0f80f/2023-07/VideoScreenshot--adapcyInstagram-0_04_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣自爆慘墮網上騙局，損失了五位數字。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c24daab975894055971a4edea64de48f/2023-07/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-GirlsTalk70000Igotscammed70000-0_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣去打Golf。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b076f70ff40ff8a3561b90e62a5b7e6a/2023-03/ADA_11_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣經常在IG派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/163352ad425fefac8a9fb9bf920fb2b3/2023-03/ADA_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣好鍾意同陽光玩遊戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05b8f061700efae42ea620a86fc2fc16/2023-03/ADA_09_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣大晒身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e4f762e274b35256c83cff4c0f8c63d/2023-03/ADA_10_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣身材惹火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9fa49beb28b1fd36667da587bf302df/2023-03/ADA_15.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣一到夏天就出海。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/126bc16de10e6bb6989e6c0a04bc883e/2023-03/ADA_12_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣湊狗仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5891c1936dff079808fdf39056dc3653/2023-03/ADA_20.jpg\"/>\n<h2>龐卓欣當選港姐亞軍轉型KOL</h2>\n<p>龐卓欣出身富裕家庭，父親為著名股評人、東驥基金管理董事總經理龐寶林，傳聞身家逾億，是名副其實的富家千金。雖然她在2015年奪得港姐亞軍，但當選後她並未選擇簽約TVB，反而憑藉獨特個人風格轉戰網絡成為人氣KOL，深受網民喜愛。在感情路上，龐卓欣於2019年與「鐘錶大王」長孫孫智威結束長達6年的戀情，同年戀上現任丈夫Patrick，兩人拍拖以來一直愛得高調，頻頻在社交平台大方放閃。去年聖誕節，Patrick更在浪漫雪地中遞上巨型鑽戒求婚成功，如今兩人終於拉埋天窗，龐卓欣過著令人羨慕的少奶奶幸福生活。</p>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣晒出與愛犬影婚紗照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afd75b9b837327891bd49dbf19b5fb27/2026-08/ADA_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣拍攝婚紗照變成「全家福」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d5e47124aff24d54886defe8600b8124/2026-08/ADA_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣今年7月曾在IG分享婚紗照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b248e0d5e00e1a1d4a7c0057b19e71c/2026-07/ADA_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣手上戴有兩隻巨型鑽戒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fbff80c675879482f1b3f1b96a63dda2/2026-07/ADA_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣的婚紗大晒身材，但不及手上的鑽戒吸引人目光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/19a0f051de049968087cd698035632c3/2026-07/ADA_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣早前偕未婚夫到泰國揀選結婚場地，順道慶祝34歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b9b53b6f610f553885873684c7d6aabc/2026-07/ADA_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣今年9月19日出嫁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4d5b8c11d326c7cf27fa31c7407fda5/2026-09/ADA_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣打扮仙氣十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d06276d569d734cc9a2fc1bc2e1ba4f2/2026-09/ADA_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣表示：「呢個Corset真係唔係講笑，好勒！我今晚大概要企一整晚。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e205a714516c5ea70002f6c042651fdc/2026-09/ADA_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣表示與未婚夫分開到會場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da2b413f47578e31a3f8e60b2b011d28/2026-09/ADA_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣註冊現場的布置。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d22d961c7080c38443e51b392e647ec2/2026-09/ADA_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"氣球上以心型圖案顯示註冊日期。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0c744b391ddd87f4e2ef042dbdc8c61/2026-09/ADA_11__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣的婚禮布置簡約。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ee20e615e9c9869f4a66e2c5d715604/2026-09/ADA_13__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣在家人見證下舉行簽字儀式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc9183074c16b7ecf810d521acd637fc/2026-09/ADA_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣的父母見證女兒出嫁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f3a9411ce6d4c7963fa05d14c2931878/2026-09/ADA_1__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"新郎宣誓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f59dafa4706cf3eeace8a2c3cb523b1b/2026-09/ADA_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣宣誓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f9aa4b55741f7b38f6b813ff8be56da/2026-09/ADA_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣的愛犬變身「花童」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d042eed36678517a60e45ac16d239b38/2026-09/ADA_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣與老公放換戒指。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d040283350adfea44b74610fe0f6c915/2026-09/ADA_18__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣與老公放換戒指。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ab8039c5d501fe8e0a5496937acd014/2026-09/ADA_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣與新婚老公咀嘴放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ef2739ed06048888607654f32e5ee39/2026-09/ADA_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣結婚只辦小型派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b5a1d177cafe7bc401f599ae90f0818/2026-09/ADA_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣獲求婚後與Patrick咀嘴放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4202113c2fd1a32e3e3ffe660c4c9b3/2026-07/ADA_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣早前分享影片大晒鑽戒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6942b1c378ebf4b574495562dd0a9b30/2026-08/ADA_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣與Patrick已一齊五年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/455c3eb581b6c2d9c77a5781fafb30a8/2026-07/ADA_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣與Patrick愛得黐纏。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42bb67cf0b8f99085c67c957c56c37a2/2026-07/ADA_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣自與金融才俊Patrick拍拖後，愛情至上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1156dfd00a88aadf4f3341f9d3e15570/2023-03/ADA_01_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Soda是龐卓欣的寶貝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4959c243e04c85eaf9c20e2a382cc27d/2026-02/adapcy_1753621417_3685966066657068278_262092175.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣說：「點解我而家會有五隻狗？就係彌補我嗰陣失去Scotch嘅空虛感覺。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6eafbb42cfc7cd38a24eaad3f67a0466/2026-02/adapcy_1721827236_3419257139485225585_262092175.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣有意在結婚之前簽訂婚前協議：「因為我以前試過有一個好唔愉快嘅分手。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/606f699064b75bfe14f09e557e63967a/2026-02/001_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣跟前男友養了一隻狗：「佢知我有咗新男友之後，就唔畀再見Scotch了。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/edffd04789fca3f31857bee262a029bc/2026-02/003_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣當刻都完全嚇到，立刻問律師朋友意見。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac0c4b6b56bcf64dee758bcaeba97abf/2026-02/004_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龐卓欣坦言當時逼於無奈向男友寄律師信，希望嚇一下他。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2504f2771215073b2c178d41161ab090/2026-02/VS--1Instagram-0_05_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T12:03:12.029508+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":677,"images":53,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:30:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:10.760656+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:10.760656+00:00","content_hash":"28ba9a7154f825aa8a18eacfc3e1fe706690386dea8ccc20ba7f2eb922833b2a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}